:: Horse Academy Train Athletics
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
<<rng 1 60>>
<<if C.npc.Rowan.love - C.npc.Rowan.dom gte $rng or $trainstage is 1>>
	Rowan leads you to the practice track at the front of the academy. "We're gonna be trainin' ya speed today. You aughta do about a dozen laps on the track and we'll see ya progress."
	<br><br>
	You spend a couple hours jogging. <span class="blue">You feel exhausted.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<if $trainstage is lt 1>>
		<<if $rng gte 40>>
			<<link [[Continue training|Midtrain Event]]>><<set $trainstage to 1>><<athletics 50>><<tiredness 20>><<pass 240>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Continue training|Horse Academy Train Athletics]]>><<set $trainstage to 1>><<athletics 50>><<tiredness 20>><<pass 240>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $rng gte 40>>
			<<link [[Next|Training Event]]>><<set $trainstage to 0>><<athletics 50>><<tiredness 20>><<pass 240>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Next|Horse Academy Entrance]]>><<set $trainstage to 0>><<athletics 50>><<tiredness 20>><<pass 240>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Rowan begins to guide you before <<he>> stops on the spot and turns to you. "Ya know, I reckon most trainers'll be stickin' to standard trainin' but... I've got somethin' special for ya."
	<br><br>
	Rowan grips your arm tight and pulls you into a deeper portion of the academy. <span class="red">The lights here are dim and it is hard to see, but you hear strange noises around you.</span>
	<br><br>
	"Now that we got ya in the back where noone'll hear, we can begin ya <span class="red">"special"</span> trainin'..."
	<br><br>
	Rowan leads you to an open room the size of an indoor pool with a small track. "Now... we're gonna let the horses out and we'll see how fast you can run."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Horse Backroom Athletics]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

