:: Post Race Mocha
<<npc "Mint Mocha">><<person1>>
<<if $pcWins is undefined>><<set $pcWins to 0>><<set $pcLosses to 0>><</if>>
<<if $regionalrace is 5>>
	<<if $raceresult is "win">>
		As you take a deep breath, letting your first victory settle in, you hear a familiar set of loud footsteps pounding toward you once more.
		<br><br>
		It's the same horsegirl from before.
		<br><br>
		She stops in front of you with a deep frown, planting her hands on her hips.
		<br><br>
		"H-How dare you!" she blurts out, pointing a finger your way.
		<br><br>
		"How dare you come in here and make me look bad?!"
		<br><br>
		Her expression twists with frustration.
		<br><br>
		"You… you… rookie loser!"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Post Race Mocha 2]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		With your hands braced against your knees as you catch your breath, you hear a confident set of footsteps pass by.<br>
		<br>
		The winner, a horsegirl named Mint Mocha, strides past without sparing you so much as a glance, basking in the applause and cheers pouring in from the crowd.
		<br><br>
		"Hmph. Obvious outcome. Stay in your lane, newbie."
		<br><br>
		She gives a dismissive huff and heads straight toward the gathering audience, already accepting the attention waiting for her in the post-race interviews. <<ggsuperiority>>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Post Race Rowan]]>><<endevent>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom += 5>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 3>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $regionalrace is 4>>
	<<if $raceresult is "win">>
		<<if $pcWins is 2>>
			The finish line disappears behind you before Mint Mocha's ever gets close.
			<br><br>
			You slow to a stop, chest heaving, and let it sink in.
			<br><br>
			You've made it! Two races and two wins.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Post Race Mocha 2]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			The finish line disappears behind you before Mint Mocha's ever gets close.
			<br><br>
			You slow to a stop, chest heaving, and let it sink in.
			<br><br>
			After that first loss, you weren't sure you'd feel the taste of victory so soon.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Post Race Mocha 2]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $pcLosses is 2>>
			The finishing line blurs past Mint Mocha.
			<br><br>
			You slow to a stop and stand there, chest heaving, staring at the track ahead of you.
			<br><br>
			Two races. Two losses.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Post Race Mocha 2]]>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			The finishing line blurs past Mint Mocha.
			<br><br>
			You slow to a stop and stand there, chest heaving, staring at the track ahead of you.
			<br><br>
			Your first loss, right after that first win.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Post Race Mocha 2]]>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $regionalrace is 0>>
	<<if $raceresult is "win">>
		You cross the line.
		<br><br>
		For a second, the world is just sound: the crowd, your own pulse, the thundering in your chest that hasn't stopped since the starting gun.
		<br><br>
		Then it hits you.
		<br><br>
		First place. Prize money. The farm.
	<<else>>
		The line crosses behind you.
		<br><br>
		You stand on the far side of the track and hear the crowd shift, the applause redistributing, moving toward someone else.
		<br><br>
		The farm. The prize money. The math that's been sitting under every training session, every pre-dawn run, every mile you've run.
		<br><br>
		You know what this means.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Post Race Final]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $raceresult is "win">>
		<<mintWinReaction>>
	<<else>>
		<<mintLossReaction>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Post Race Mocha 2

<<if $regionalrace is 5>>
	<<if $raceresult is "win">>
		The horsegirl glares at you, visibly fuming.
		<br><br>
		"God! I can hardly stand looking at you!"
		<br><br>
		She huffs and lifts her chin.
		<br><br>
		"Listen up! I'm gonna train harder and beat you next time!"<<llsuperiority>>
		<br><br>
		A beat of silence passes before she adds, quieter now, like she needs the last word.
		<br><br>
		"You got that?"
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Next|Post Race Mint Mocha 3]]>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 5>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 10>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $regionalrace is 4>>
	<<if $raceresult is "win">>
		<<if $pcWins is 2>>
			Mint Mocha comes to a stop several paces off, chest heaving, staring at you like she can't quite process the scoreboard.
			<br><br>
			"Again?!" Her voice cracks with disbelief. "That's twice now!"
			<br><br>
			She presses her lips into a thin line, composure slipping. "I don't understand it. I trained harder than you. I know I did." <<llsuperiority>>
			<br><br>
			She straightens up, forcing her chin high despite the way her hands are shaking at her sides. "Whatever. It won't happen a third time."
			<br><br>
			She turns on her heel and stalks off before you can respond, already muttering to herself about training schedules.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Post Race Rowan]]>><<endevent>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 5>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 10>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			Mint Mocha stops a short distance away, staring at the board with her jaw slack.
			<br><br>
			"Wait. You— didn't you lose last time?" Her composure cracks, confusion bleeding into her frustration.
			<br><br>
			She shakes her head sharply, like she's trying to reset herself. "No. No, this is a fluke. A one-time thing." <<llsuperiority>>
			<br><br>
			She points a finger your way, though it wavers a little. "Don't get comfortable, rookie. I'm still better than you."
			<br><br>
			She turns and marches off, hair tossed over her shoulder, muttering under her breath.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Post Race Rowan]]>><<endevent>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom -= 5>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 10>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $pcLosses is 2>>
			Mint Mocha doesn't even bother slowing down this time, just glances at you sidelong as <<he>> passes.
			<br><br>
			"Two for two, huh?" <<He>> hums, pleased with <<himself>>. "At this rate I won't even remember your name." <<glove>>
			<br><br>
			<<He>> keeps walking, already looking past you toward <<his>> next interview, like you've stopped being worth <<his>> attention at all.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Post Race Rowan]]>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom += 5>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 3>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			Mint Mocha strides past you toward the crowd, but slows just enough to look back over her shoulder.
			<br><br>
			"Oh?" Her mouth curls into something smug. "Guess that first win really was a fluke." <<ggsuperiority>>
			<br><br>
			She tosses her hair, clearly savoring it. "Don't worry. I'm sure you'll get used to this feeling. Losing, I mean."
			<br><br>
			She gives a light, satisfied laugh before continuing on toward the crowd waiting for her.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Post Race Rowan]]>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].dom += 5>><<set C.npc["Mint Mocha"].love += 3>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Post Race Mint Mocha 3
With one last pout, she tosses her hair over her shoulder and turns away, frustration written all over her face.
<br><br>
The crowd parts as the green-haired horsegirl storms off.
<br><br>
Before your brain can fully register her words, you feel a light tap on your shoulder from behind.
<br><br>
As you turn around, you're greeted by Rowan's smirking face.
