<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
<<if $regionalrace is 5>>
	<<if $raceresult is "win">>
		<<if C.npc.Rowan.love gt 60>>
			"I knew you had it in you!" <<He>> exclaims, cupping your face as <<he>> beams at you.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> pulls back just enough to look you over, like <<he>>'s checking the win actually happened and not just imagining it.
			<br><br>
			"First race, and you already got that loudmouth chasing her own tail." <<He>> laughs, shaking <<his>> head. "Didn't even have to tell you to do it. You just went out there and did it."
			<br><br>
			<<He>> bumps <<his>> knuckles lightly against your jaw, fond and a little smug.
			<br><br>
			"Knew there was somethin' in you the day I picked you out." <<His>> voice softens, just slightly. "Glad I was right."<<stress -4>><<glove>>
			<br>
			<br>
			<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set $horseacademycountdown to 7>><<endevent>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom -= 5>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 5>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<He>> looks you over once, slow, like <<he>>'s doing an inspection rather than offering congratulations.
			<br><br>
			"Huh." A short breath through <<his>> nose, almost a laugh but not quite. "Didn't think you had that in you." <<glove>>
			<br><br>
			There's no smile waiting for you. <<He>> merely watches you, arms still crossed.
			<br><br>
			"Don't go gettin' comfortable." Rowan's voice stays flat. "One win don't mean much. Coulda been luck. Coulda been that other horsegirl havin' an off day."
			<br><br>
			<<He>> steps in close, tilting <<his>> head down at you, and for a second you think <<he>>'s about to say something warmer. <<He>> doesn't.
			<br><br>
			"Now get back here." <<He>> jerks <<his>> chin toward the training grounds, already turning <<his>> back on you. "We got work to do. A win like that's just gonna make me push you harder." <<stress 4>> <<gdom>>
			<br><br>
			<<He>> doesn't wait to see if you follow.
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set $horseacademycountdown to 7>><<endevent>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 3>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 5>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if C.npc.Rowan.love gt 60>>
			You lift your head and immediately spot Rowan jogging your way. There's a grin on <<his>> face despite the loss.
			<br><br>
			Before you can even open your mouth, <<he>>'s already in front of you, both hands settling on your shoulders.
			<br><br>
			"What's with the long face, darlin'?" <<His>> grin widens. "This was only your first race. No need to beat yourself up over it. You'll get plenty more chances to make up for it."
			<br><br>
			The young trainer lifts a finger and flicks the base of your horse ear, earning a quick twitch in response. "Plenty of chances to make it up to me." <<He>> throws in a wink.
			<br><br>
			"For a first race, this wasn't half bad." Rowan gives your shoulder a firm smack. "So quit moping and let's get back to training!"
			<br><br>
			Before you can get a word in, <<he>>'s already tugging you along after <<him>>. <<stress -4>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set $horseacademycountdown to 7>><<endevent>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 5>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love -= 5>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			You lift your head. Rowan's making <<his>> way over at an easy pace, hands buried deep in <<his>> pockets.
			<br><br>
			<<He>> stops beside you and looks down for a moment, the disappointment in <<his>> eyes plain enough despite the way <<he>> tries to hide it. <<llove>>
			<br><br>
			Then <<he>> clicks <<his>> tongue and gives your shoulder a couple of firm smacks. "Reckon I've been lettin' you off too easy." A quiet sigh leaves <<his>> nose. 
			<br><br>
			"Been treatin' ya too soft." Rowan glances toward the crowd before finally turning <<his>> attention back to you. "Guess I oughta start workin' ya harder." <<gdom>>
			<br><br>
			There's something in <<his>> eyes that makes your shoulders tense. You get the feeling training isn't going to stay comfortable from here on out. <<stress 6>>
			<br><br>
			<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set $horseacademycountdown to 7>><<endevent>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 5>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love -= 5>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<<elseif $regionalrace is 4>>
	<<if $raceresult is "win">>
