				<br><br>
				"See?! Didn't I tell you?!" <<He>> pulls back just enough to look at you, eyes bright. "Told you that first one didn't mean a thing!"
				<br><br>
				<<He>> laughs, a little breathless <<himself>>, and presses <<his>> forehead to yours. "You went out there and proved it. Proved it to everybody, but mostly to yourself, I'd bet." <<glove>>
