				<br><br>
				<<He>> doesn't smile. If anything <<his>> jaw sets tighter. "Told you the extra hours would pay off. Don't think it means we're easin' up." <<gdom>>
				<br><br>
				<<He>> turns and starts walking, not waiting to see if you follow. "Now let's see if you can make it three."
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set $horseacademycountdown to 7>><<endevent>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 3>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 5>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<<else>>
		<<if $pcLosses is 2>>
			<<if C.npc.Rowan.love gt 60>>
				Rowan falls into step beside you without a word, sparing Mint Mocha nothing more than a flat glance as <<he>> passes.
				<br><br>
				For a moment, <<he>> just walks with you, hands in <<his>> pockets, close enough that <<his>> shoulder brushes yours.
				<br><br>
				"Two in a row's rough, I know." <<His>> voice is quieter than usual, careful. "But I'm not seein' a quitter standin' next to me. I'm seein' someone who's gonna go home and figure out what to fix."<<stress -4>>
				<br><br>
				<<He>> bumps your arm with <<his>> elbow. "That's the part that matters to me. Not the number on the board."
				<br><br>
				<<link [[Comfort <<Him>>|Rowan Comfort]]>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Stay Quiet|Rowan Quiet]]>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				You hear <<him>> before you see <<him>>. Boots on packed dirt, followed by a sigh.
				<br><br>
				Rowan comes to a stop a few paces away. <<He>> doesn't say anything at first. Just looks at you with <<his>> arms crossed, jaw set tighter than last time.
				<br><br>
				"Two." <<He>> says it flat, like <<he>>'s counting out loud for <<himself>> more than you. <<llove>>
				<br><br>
				<<He>> rolls <<his>> shoulders and tilts <<his>> head toward the exit. "This ain't lookin' like a pattern I like. C'mon. We got a lot of ground to make up." <<gdom>>
				<br><br>
				<<He>>'s already walking before you've caught your breath. Not bothering to offer you comfort.
