				<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 5>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love -= 5>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<if C.npc.Rowan.love gt 60>>
				Rowan falls into step beside you without a word, ignoring Mint Mocha entirely like <<he>>'s not even worth the attention.
