:: Rowan Tail Dodge
<<if $danceskill gte 400>>
	You read the motion in <<his>> shoulders a half-second before his hand comes down, and you twist out of reach, putting a few feet of distance between you and that smug grin.
	<br><br>
	<<His>> hand swats empty air.
	<br><br>
	"Oh, real cute." <<He>> huffs out a laugh, more impressed than annoyed, and tucks <<his>> hands back into <<his>> pockets, looking entirely too pleased with you for someone who just missed.
	<br><br>
	"Quick on your feet when it counts, huh?" <<He>> tilts <<his>> head, eyeing you like <<he>>'s reassessing something. "Don't get used to it. I'll catch you eventually."<<glove>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 3>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You try to twist out of the way, but you're half a second too slow.
	<br><br>
	<<His>> palm connects with a solid smack, the sound louder than it has any right to be.
	<br><br>
	You yelp, ears flattening, a hand flying back to rub at the sting.<<pain 4>><<gpain>>
	<br><br>
	Rowan grins down at you, entirely unrepentant.
	<br><br>
	"Reflexes need work too, darlin'." <<He>> says it like a fond observation rather than an apology. "Add it to the list."<<stress 3>><<gstress>><<gdom>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 3>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Rowan Tail Goad
Instead of dodging, you arch into it, tail flicking, chin lifted in challenge.
<br><br>
"That all you got?"
<br><br>
<<His>> hand stills mid-air for half a second. Long enough that you know you caught <<him>> off guard.
<br><br>
Then a slow grin spreads across <<his>> face.
<br><br>
"Careful what you ask for." <<His>> palm lands anyway, but slower this time, lingering rather than swatting, fingers curling against your hip before pulling back. "Keep talkin' like that, and we're never gonna finish trainin' today."<<arousal 6>><<garousal>><<gdom>><<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 5>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 3>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Ear Bite
You open your mouth to answer...
<br><br>
...but instead feel a quick bite at the tip of your ear.
<br><br>
Your other ear flicks immediately.
<br><br>
<<He>> lets out an amused hum and gives your shoulder a hearty smack.
<br><br>
"Aw, don't look at me like that. Couldn't resist."
<br><br>
And just like that, <<he>> saunters away.
<<if C.npc.Rowan.love gt 60>>
<<arousal 6>><<garousal>>
<<else>>
<<stress 6>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Water Tease
"Careful," you say, wiping your mouth. "Almost sounded like a compliment."
<br><br>
Rowan barks out a laugh, surprised out of <<him>>.
<br><br>
"Don't go gettin' used to it." <<He>> pushes off the fence and closes the distance, plucking the water bottle out of your hand to take a swig <<himself>>, like it's the most natural thing in the world. "There. Now we're even."
<br><br>
"Even on what?" you ask.
<br><br>
"Nothin'." <<He>> hands it back, smug as ever, but <<he>>'s standing closer than <<he>> needs to be, and <<he>> doesn't step away.<<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 3>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Water Quiet
You don't say anything, just drink, watching the morning haze burn off the fields over Rowan's shoulder.
<br><br>
Rowan doesn't fill the silence either. <<He>> just stands there with you, arms crossed, content to let the quiet be quiet.
<br><br>
After a while, <<he>> nudges your foot with <<his>>. "What's on that pretty mind of yours?"
<br><br>
"Just thinking."
<br><br>
"'Bout?"
<br><br>
You shrug. Rowan studies you a second longer than the question warrants, like <<he>>'s decided not to push, then just bumps your shoulder with <<his>>, easy and warm.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Stretch Help
You let yourself lean into it, and <<his>> hands settle warm and steady against your shoulder blades, easing you forward with a gentleness that doesn't match the calluses on his palms.
<br><br>
"There. Just like that." <<His>> voice has dropped, quieter than the open field really calls for. "Breathe into it. Don't fight it."
<br><br>
You're suddenly very aware of how close <<he>> is, of the warmth radiating off <<him>>, of how easily one of <<his>> hands could just keep sliding.
<br><br>
It doesn't. <<He>> holds the stretch a beat longer than strictly necessary, then pulls back, clearing <<his>> throat like <<he>> caught <<himself>> somewhere <<he>> didn't mean to go.
<br><br>
"...Better?"
<br><br>
"Yeah." Your voice comes out a little rougher than intended.<<arousal 4>><<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 3>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Stretch Off
"I got it," you say, scooting back half a step before <<his>> hands can land.
<br><br>
Rowan raises both hands, easy and unbothered, but there's a glint of amusement in <<his>> eyes <<he>> doesn't bother hiding.
<br><br>
"Suit yourself." <<He>> settles back on <<his>> heels to watch instead, chin propped on one hand. "Just figured I'd save you the trouble of fallin' on your face."
<br><br>
"I'm not going to fall on my face." you say.
<br><br>
"Uh huh." <<He>> doesn't believe you for a second, and <<he>> doesn't stop watching, that small private smile tugging at the corner of <<his>> mouth the whole time.<<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 2>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Complain
"You're kidding," you pant. "Two more?"
<br><br>
Rowan doesn't even look up. "Do I look like I'm kiddin'?"
<br><br>
"Rowan—"
<br><br>
"Two more laps," <<he>> repeats, slower this time, like <<he>>'s enjoying this slightly more than he should. "Or we make it three."<<gdom>><<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
You decide against testing that.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Push Through
You don't argue. You just go, legs burning, breath ragged, refusing to give <<him>> the satisfaction of hearing you complain.
<br><br>
Rowan watches you finish the set without a word, but there's something in his expression when you stagger to a stop in front of <<him>>.
<br><br>
"Didn't think you had that in you." <<He>> tosses you a towel. "Good. Keep that up."<<stress 3>><<gstress>><<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 2>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Rowan Share Treat
You break off a piece and hold it out to <<him>> before he can object.
<br><br>
Rowan blinks, clearly not expecting that, then takes it, looking almost bashful about it. "Didn't get it for me."
<br><br>
"I know. Take it anyway."
<br><br>
<<He>> eats it in one bite, watching you the whole time with an expression you can't quite name. "...Thanks." <<He>> says it quieter than the moment really calls for.<<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 4>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Keep Treat
You take it without hesitation, already halfway through the first bite before he's finished talking.
<br><br>
Rowan snorts. "Don't even pretend to think about sharin', huh?"
<br><br>
"Nope."
<br><br>
"Cold-blooded." But <<he>>'s grinning when <<he>> says it, watching you enjoy it like that alone was worth the trip into town.<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Mood Push
"Okay, what's going on with you today?"
<br><br>
Rowan's jaw tightens. "Nothin'. Drop it."
<br><br>
"You've been gloomy all morning-"
<br><br>
"I said drop it." <<His>> voice is harder than you've heard it in a while, and it lands like a slap, even though <<he>> doesn't raise it.<<stress 4>><<gstress>><<llove>>
<br><br>
<<He>> seems to catch himself a beat too late, mouth opening like <<he>> might walk it back, but <<he>> doesn't. <<He>> just turns and gets back to work.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love -= 3>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Mood Space
You don't push. You just keep your distance, let <<him>> have whatever's eating at <<him>> without poking at it.
<br><br>
It takes most of the morning, but eventually <<he>> exhales hard, shoulders dropping a fraction. "...Sorry. Bank called. Wasn't about you."
<br><br>
"Okay."
<br><br>
"Just okay?" <<He>> almost laughs, some of the tension finally bleeding out of <<his>> frame. "Most people'd want details." 
<br><br>
"You'll tell me when you want to." That seems to land somewhere <<he>> wasn't expecting. <<He>> doesn't say anything else, but <<he>> stands a little closer for the rest of the day.<<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 3>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Mistake Apologize
"Sorry. I'll get it right."
<br><br>
Rowan studies you for a second, the sharp edge in <<his>> expression softening, just slightly. "...Yeah. Again. From the top."
<br><br>
<<He>> doesn't apologise for snapping, but <<he>> does correct your stance more patiently the second time around, and that's about as close to sorry as Rowan tends to get.<<stress 3>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Mistake Argue
"Maybe if you explained it instead of just barking orders—"
<br><br>
"I have explained it. Three times." <<His>> jaw is tight, patience visibly thinning. "Maybe try actually listenin' instead of makin' excuses."
<br><br>
The words land sharper than either of you probably meant them to, and for a second, neither of you says anything else, the air between you gone tense and brittle.<<stress 5>><<gstress>><<gdom>><<llove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love -= 3>><<set C.npc.Rowan.dom += 4>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Drill Break
"Can we.. can we stop a second?" you ask.
<br><br>
Rowan's expression doesn't soften much, but <<he>> clicks the stopwatch off anyway.
<br><br>
"...Thirty seconds." <<He>> taps <<his>> wrist. "Then we go again."<<stress -6>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Drill Grit
You don't ask. You just keep moving until your legs threaten to give out entirely.
<br><br>
Rowan finally calls it <<himself>>, watching you sway in place with something unreadable in <<his>> eyes.
<br><br>
"...That's enough for today." <<His>> voice has gone quieter. "Didn't need you provin' a point that hard."<<stress 5>><<gstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Tape Comply
You hold still and let <<him>> work, watching the top of <<his>> bowed head, the careful concentration on <<his>> face.
<br><br>
"There. Good." <<He>> jots the number down without looking up. "Longer stride than last month. Whatever you're doin', keep doin' it."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Tape Point
"You know this is kind of a weird angle for you to be at," you say.
<br><br>
Rowan freezes, then looks up at you from <<his>> knees with an expression of pure betrayal.
<br><br>
"I'm measurin' your stride." <<His>> ears go faintly red despite the protest. "Get your head outta the gutter."
<br><br>
"I didn't say anything." you say. "You were thinkin' it." <<He>> stands up too fast, clearing <<his>> throat, refusing to meet your eyes for a solid minute afterward.<<arousal 4>><<garousal>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Brush Relax
You let your shoulders drop and your eyes fall half-shut, the brush dragging long and even through your hair.
<br><br>
"There you go." <<His>> voice goes low, almost a murmur. "Knew you were holdin' all that stress somewhere."
<br><br>
<<He>> doesn't stop, even once the knots are worked loose, fingers occasionally brushing your scalp in a way that feels far more deliberate than careless.<<stress -4>><<arousal 4>><<lstress>><<garousal>><<glove>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<set C.npc.Rowan.love += 4>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Brush Insist
"I can do that myself, you know." You say.
<br><br>
"Didn't say you couldn't." <<He>> doesn't hand the brush back. "Just figured I'd do it anyway."
<br><br>
<<He>> keeps brushing, ignoring your protest entirely, an amused little smile tugging at <<his>> mouth the whole time <<he>> pretends not to notice you giving up the argument.<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Horse Academy]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

