:: Sore Loser - Ask
"What do you mean?" You ask.
<br><br>
She steps closer, frustration and something far more confusing tangled together in her expression. "I keep losin' to you, and I should hate it. I hate it!" Her voice drops. "So why do I keep findin' excuses to be wherever you are?"
<br><br>
She looks almost as surprised by the admission as you are, jaw working like she's trying to take it back.<<arousal 4>>
<br><br>
